    {
      "id": "quiet_company_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "うん。じゃあ、今日は大きい話をしなくてもいいよ。隣にいる感じだけ、少し置いておくね。",
      "translatedText": "Mm. Then we do not have to make this a big conversation today. I will just leave a little sense of sitting beside you here.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "pose": "sitting_near",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "quiet_company_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "quiet_company_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "何か言葉が出てきたら聞くし、出てこなくても大丈夫。静かな時間も、ちゃんと一緒に過ごせるから。",
      "translatedText": "If words come, I will listen. If they do not, that is okay too. Quiet time can still be time we spend together.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
